## License

This project is licensed under the MIT License.

Why we chose MIT:

- It is short and simple, so it is easy to understand.
- It lets anyone use, copy, and change the code, as long as the license notice stays.
- The code libraries we use (@tonejs/midi, Tone.js, PixiJS, Vitest, Vite) are also MIT, so the licenses fit well together.

Some non-code materials, such as the piano samples and sample songs, have their own licenses.
See [Third-Party Materials](#third-party-materials) for sources and license details.
